-- pixelrp: Builders > Designer is organised by what the furni is, not by who
-- made it.
--
-- 92 gave every designer a page and every pack a page under it. Shopping that
-- meant knowing the designer; kitchens sat under four of them and bathrooms
-- under three. Now Designer holds seventeen categories with themed pages, and
-- every designer's furni is filed by its pack's theme - the four packs that
-- mixed everything (Freesias' Others, Caitlin's Custom, Verena's Customs,
-- Linette's New) a furni at a time. Kasja, which 89 put inside Designer, is
-- sorted the same way, pack by pack. No designer names remain.
--
-- 4235 furni, into:
--   Kitchen                  Modern Kitchen 51, Rustic Kitchen 21, Kitschy Kitchen 47, Kitchen Essentials 75
--   Bathroom                 64
--   Living Room & Bedroom    Living Room 148, Bedroom 27, Rooms 56, Cozy Home 45, Household 85
--   Modern                   Modern 209, Studio 14, Industrial 4, Monochrome 58
--   Scandinavian & Cabin     Japandi 130, Scandi 38, Danish 62, Chalet 46
--   Cottage & Country        Rustic 35, Cottage 29, Summer House 49, Frog Home 26, Cozy Winter 19, Country House 37, Autumn 17, Farm 33
--   Retro                    50s 79, 60s 62, 70s 29
--   Aesthetic & Pastel       Aesthetic 137, Pastel 33, Pink & Elegant 38, Daisy Dream 27, Bubblegum 20, Funky 13
--   Asian                    Japanese 49, Korean 40, Oriental 49, Sakura 99, Chinese 73, Asian Village 58, Ghibli 62
--   Fantasy & Medieval       Fantasy 140, Castle & Royal 37, Fortress 34, Middle Ages 47, Witchcraft 23, Blacksmith 14, Medieval House 18
--   Greek & Classical        13
--   Garden & Nature          Garden 123, Plants 89, Flowers 36, Nature 40
--   Beach & Water            Beach 36, Beach House 43, Waterland 21, Cove 9, Arctic 13
--   Holidays                 Christmas 114, Halloween 10, Valentine's Day 14
--   Shops, Cafés & Venues    Cafés 42, Cinema 8, Prison 7, Sports Shop 16, Street 14, Market 52, Mailboxes & Sewing 45, Bubble Juice 12, Attic & Grunge 25
--   Building & Structure     Blocks 78, Construction 31, Walls & Floors 89, Borders 7, Exteriors 85, House Set 149
--   Decoration & Art         Decorations 327, Picture Frames 21, Art 11, Neon 5, Crafts 32, Teddy Bears 12
--
-- New pages have fixed ids (955000+) and icons made from their first furni
-- (icon_<7000000 + sprite>.png, 197's scheme). A furni moves only while it is
-- on a page under Designer; the old designer and pack pages (84's 940002-
-- 940999 and 92's 942000-942999) go once empty, as does any new page nothing
-- reached. 84's divider (940001) sits in Builders, not Designer, and stays.
-- Idempotent: fixed ids, and a second run moves nothing it has not moved.

SET @builders := (SELECT `id` FROM `catalog_pages` WHERE `parent_id` = -1 AND `caption` = 'Builders' LIMIT 1);
SET @designer := COALESCE(
    (SELECT `id` FROM `catalog_pages` WHERE `id` = 941000 LIMIT 1),
    (SELECT `id` FROM `catalog_pages` WHERE `parent_id` = @builders AND `caption` IN ('Designer', 'Designer Furni') ORDER BY `id` LIMIT 1));

